OL,3,AAt least one dead after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto crowd in northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least one person has been killed and
OL,7,F10 people injured after a car crashed
OL,8,Finto a group of people near a train
OL,9,Fstation in northern France, police say.
OL,11,FA male suspect was later arrested after
OL,12,Fauthorities launched a major emergency
OL,13,Fresponse in Caen, in the Normandy
OL,14,Fregion.
OL,16,FLocal prefect David Claviere said seven
OL,17,Fof those injured were in a critical
OL,18,Fcondition and three more had minor
OL,19,Finjuries, AFP reported.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
