OL,3,AAt least one dead after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto crowd in northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident took place near a bar,
OL,7,Fwith local media reporting that a fight
OL,8,Fhad broken out there before the
OL,9,Fincident took place.
